      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The local soil, part of the Axtell Vertisol series, drains well but cracks when dry, historically supporting tall‑grass prairie grasses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Axtell,_Texas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Axtell is best known as the site of the Mount Carmel Center, the location of the 1993 Waco Siege.",
